Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Infuriating!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.15,0:00:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is absolutely vexing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.57,0:00:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Majesty, you're covered in filth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:36.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moreover, where are all the others?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.97,0:00:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did I bother giving them high caliber\Nweaponry if they don't know how to use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.61,0:00:48.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Majesty, what in heaven is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.81,0:00:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon of calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.43,0:01:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Brio-Lak should have destroyed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.05,0:01:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.65,0:01:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it resurrected somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.13,0:01:10.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They do have that damn cleric.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.55,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That infernal healer who can use his\Nmagic far beyond anyone else. Sane.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.71,0:01:17.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But even if he did heal it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.75,0:01:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be impossible for them\Nto just sick that dragon on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone must be controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.17,0:01:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Demon folk.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is our monster person? Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.17,0:01:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is the Beast Tabor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course, Master Lude.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has already left for Sorenza.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.87,0:01:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spoke of urgent business there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.57,0:01:39.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, that damned Quisling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.23,0:01:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Change sides, Azzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.15,0:01:44.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you not try to detain him?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.63,0:01:48.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you told us to give\Nhim special treatment, so I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.23,0:01:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My liege, please compose yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.39,0:01:57.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I suggest you stop standing around like an\Nass and come up with a plan to fix this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:01:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damned good fun of things!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.75,0:02:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.66,0:02:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, get the device ready! The device?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure which one you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.59,0:02:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Koraunos, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Koraunos?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.95,0:02:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And be quick about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.01,0:02:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, with all due respect, sir, the\NKoraunos weapon is still in testing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Output remains too high and the\Nsights are unpredictable at best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.01,0:02:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it is wildly dangerous to use\Nwithin the city, you wretched coward!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.83,0:02:26.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you not see the disaster\Nthat is right in front of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.95,0:02:28.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.19,0:02:31.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the risk of massive\Ncollateral damage is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.21,0:02:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:38.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We only need one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:39.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.47,0:02:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will take to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:43.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if you cannot aim it\Nproperly and implement
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.53,0:02:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mana tracing on the gun barrel\Nright as you command? Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.01,0:02:48.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mindless abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow you out\Nof the sky without a trace!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.37,0:02:57.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Acquiring target, direction 1120.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.83,0:02:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angle of fire, 40 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.57,0:03:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mana tracing applied.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.59,0:03:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold the greatest technological\Nwonder in the Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.97,0:03:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Developed under the wise leadership\Nof Doradus III, the Light of Judgment!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.47,0:03:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Peri!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.01,0:03:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the trajectory of Karanos has been\Naltered and now it's raining down on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.31,0:03:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.14,0:03:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The beam was programmed to trace mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.37,0:03:37.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's now targeting our mana furnaces!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you ever use\Nsomething like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:41.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you no sense at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.99,0:03:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting off this merry-go-round!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are in charge now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.95,0:03:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a direct order!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.13,0:03:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.55,0:03:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.61,0:03:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is an order from\Nyour direct superior.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's for the pleasure, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.61,0:04:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cowards!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.89,0:04:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have your heads for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.87,0:04:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, no, not those!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.11,0:04:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything but those!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.55,0:04:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not my babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.73,0:04:17.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.39,0:04:21.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breaking stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.69,0:04:36.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:39.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look at me, I'm\Ngoing to go to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.89,0:04:52.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look at me, I can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.97,0:04:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.95,0:05:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.47,0:05:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.59,0:06:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I seem to\Nhave lost track of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.71,0:06:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to pinpoint him but it's as if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's something\Npreventing me from doing so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.31,0:06:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he must be in a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,building made of monometal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.15,0:06:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:14.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.17,0:06:19.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.08,0:06:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, something's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's brighter than the light from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.05,0:06:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fly out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:28.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get behind me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.65,0:06:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.53,0:06:35.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quill got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.69,0:06:46.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.29,0:06:56.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.07,0:07:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were the one who ordered me to come\Nup with a way to fix this, my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, Tregers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.92,0:07:04.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize this is\Ntreason against the crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is the only way we can\Nensure the Empire survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.43,0:07:08.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.79,0:07:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help me. Seize them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.37,0:07:14.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no one here who is\Nstill willing to obey you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reap what you sow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.86,0:07:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sparkly gold old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.21,0:07:33.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.77,0:07:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you mean to protect this man? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.63,0:07:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you need to stay out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.29,0:07:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what's going\Non, but let's calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.99,0:07:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old-timer, stay low.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you attacking me for?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.07,0:07:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is a seasoned bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.15,0:07:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must charge together.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.43,0:07:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.35,0:07:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see no other way to interpret this\Nthan what is right in front of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:07:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That man has brought irreparable\Nharm upon our country,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.57,0:08:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and he must atone for\Nit with his very life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you guys have some issues,\Nbut can't you just talk it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.23,0:08:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were that possible, we'd have done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.13,0:08:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that a bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.73,0:08:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.89,0:08:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you all ganging\Nup on him like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.31,0:08:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's just an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who sent him flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, yeah, but isn't he supposed to\Nbe, like, your big emperor or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is all really confusing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.40,0:08:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.27,0:08:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? I gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you knock it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.43,0:08:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.26,0:08:48.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can\Njust kill him yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.03,0:08:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm not going to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy's super old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.99,0:08:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll probably die any day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let nature do its thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.15,0:08:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do not have a single moment to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:08:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our enemies are invading our territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.25,0:09:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they have the Dragon\Nof Calamity with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's invading?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.79,0:09:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to show them that we have\Nabsolutely no intention of fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.97,0:09:12.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our country is doomed unless\Nwe offer them his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.73,0:09:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is for our survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:16.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.65,0:09:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We appreciate your thoughtfulness,\Nbut there will be no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.67,0:09:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For dead men cannot suffer while\Nthey atone for their crimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.45,0:09:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.75,0:09:28.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.66,0:09:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you made it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.87,0:09:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was going to eat\Nit, but I really lucked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.87,0:09:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they who I think they are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:41.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surnar, if you would please, allow\Nus to take care of things from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.57,0:09:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're pretty riled up, but I've\Nbeen trying to talk them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you try giving it a shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:47.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:52.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lin, could you go with Sir\NNoor to tend to his wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.67,0:09:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.83,0:09:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get you patched up. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.19,0:09:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck sorting it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.85,0:10:01.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.87,0:10:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has been quite a while since we\Nlast encountered you. Prince Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please lower your weapons, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.01,0:10:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and before anything, we would like\Nto have a discussion with this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, spare my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.05,0:10:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to live?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.67,0:10:21.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me that you\Nwant to receive compassion?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:23.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.23,0:10:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fully intend to forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.83,0:10:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes? Really? Then I...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:29.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are 23 people in our nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.27,0:10:30.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.33,0:10:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,19 people have been buried\Nunder crumbling homes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.79,0:10:37.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,13 have been burned to death in fires.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.89,0:10:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,38 people injured by falling debris.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.67,0:10:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, there are\Npeople who were torn apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.27,0:10:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crushed, and reduced to\Nmangled pieces of flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.61,0:10:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,by the beasts you unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.65,0:10:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are 127 of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:55.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That total is the number of\Ncasualties in my country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.77,0:10:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I'm certain that\Nmore will be discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, why are you telling me all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.01,0:11:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because as I said earlier,\NI will forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.75,0:11:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only after you have\Nexperienced the same amount
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.09,0:11:12.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of suffering as all those\Npeople I just mentioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.05,0:11:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.09,0:11:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Only then will we hold talks about\Nreparations and ending the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.45,0:11:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What say you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are there objections?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.03,0:11:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.65,0:11:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.91,0:11:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot go through with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.39,0:11:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be some other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.27,0:11:31.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.87,0:11:34.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll experience their\Npain, but you won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we tear off both your\Nlegs and pulverize your innards,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.61,0:11:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall make sure you are\Nhealed enough to survive it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.43,0:11:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least enough to talk to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.95,0:11:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.67,0:11:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you cannot handle it\Nand you lose consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.09,0:11:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we'll just bring you back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Feel free to cry and\Nscream as much as you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.61,0:12:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get me wrong, Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.03,0:12:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, we're not doing this\Nbecause we want to relish in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What we do want though\Nis for you to thoroughly
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.47,0:12:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,understand the pain that you\Nhave put our people through.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.95,0:12:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.87,0:12:17.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then you can consider\Nyourself forgiven.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.67,0:12:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because our nation is incredibly\Nmerciful, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.15,0:12:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are so good at healing stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.91,0:12:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you. I try.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.19,0:12:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So much damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did that light from earlier do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.77,0:12:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.31,0:12:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mana beam that you\Ndeflected was split apart and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.59,0:12:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then started raining down\Non the Imperial Capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.35,0:12:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, didn't mean for that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let it bother you, Instructor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.39,0:12:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You only did it to protect us\Nand the good of the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.49,0:13:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, that may be true, but\NI didn't want anyone to get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.99,0:13:05.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, you don't have\Nto worry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.19,0:13:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, the facilities that\Ngot destroyed were mana furnaces.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.55,0:13:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mana furnaces? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.49,0:13:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those areas have a very\Nhigh concentration of mana,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:15.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so people aren't able to enter them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:16.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:18.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then that's good, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.53,0:13:22.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course, it will still affect\Nthe lives of the citizens here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.47,0:13:25.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But not so much that they\Ncan't recover from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:29.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.71,0:13:36.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ben, it's all over now, right? Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:40.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we're all moving towards\Ncoordinating post-war reconstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.53,0:13:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, the war barely started and now\Nyou're telling us that it's already over?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I really don't understand why we just\Ndidn't talk it out from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:52.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, what about the old fella?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.47,0:13:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The emperor guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.69,0:13:56.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He chose to step down\Nand abdicate the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:14:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is most likely his grandchild will\Nbe chosen to inherit the crown next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.99,0:14:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like a little kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.35,0:14:04.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are but ten years old at this point,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:07.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means that a guardian\Nhas to be appointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.17,0:14:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the ten you met earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.11,0:14:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those guys are gonna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor, do I have your name right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.87,0:14:18.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.51,0:14:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I misunderstood the situation\Nwhen we turned our blades on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will do whatever it\Ntakes to make amends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.55,0:14:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really worried about\Nit, so no need for all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.73,0:14:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But please, ganging up on\Nthe elderly is kind of wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.97,0:14:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should check your principles.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:35.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, that is something to be ashamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And had you not been there to\Nstop us from going further,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:41.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our empire would have certainly\Nended up in a very nasty civil war.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I would like to thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:45.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.09,0:14:46.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't deserve any thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I'm really the one who got saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was a goner when I\Nstupidly jumped off the dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But luckily, you guys had a floor\Nright there to break my fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.19,0:15:00.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, friend, whatever you call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you truly are an amusing man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is an honor and a\Npleasure to have met you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.81,0:15:10.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please, you need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.95,0:15:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From this moment on, the Ten will\Nspare no expense to assist you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:18.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if you ever need our\Nhelp, just say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will risk our lives\Nto come to your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.13,0:15:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a bit heavy on the\Ndramatics, but I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.61,0:15:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not hesitate to ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.97,0:15:29.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyways, guys, sorry I got\Nyour city all messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.69,0:15:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.99,0:15:33.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not concern yourself with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.15,0:15:37.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of right now, there have been\Nno reports of any dead or injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.83,0:15:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crimes committed by our country,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.21,0:15:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which threw away the treaty\Nand attacked your nation,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are far more serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.89,0:15:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure, but please let me\Nknow what I can do to help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can at least drag\Nout some of the rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.15,0:15:51.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.13,0:15:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a good-hearted\Nperson to a fault, I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.25,0:16:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it said it's bored and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.63,0:16:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wants to go home that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:02.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bid you farewell from now on we will
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.31,0:16:10.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,correspond through messengers yes please
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.01,0:16:15.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,return home safely I almost forgot sir
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.13,0:16:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no forgive me I I never shared my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Imperial Sorcerer Sir\NRandeus, of the Circuit of Ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.47,0:16:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay. Rand...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Randy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.03,0:16:28.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll remember, Randall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:33.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do look forward to seeing\Nyou once again someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.83,0:16:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Same, Ricky.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:37.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. We're off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.15,0:16:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo, can you ask it\Nsomething for me? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.53,0:16:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the way home, can we fly a\Nlittle closer to the ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:57.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll ask it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.71,0:17:02.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can see how deeply concerned he is\Nabout the damage done to this nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a compassionate person he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.91,0:17:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must learn from his example.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.35,0:17:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, we have all returned safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.09,0:17:15.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can report the war is now over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.57,0:17:17.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would like for you\Nto do the negotiating.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.87,0:17:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can fill me in on all the\Ndetails later this evening,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.79,0:17:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and now I must extend\Nthanks to our Savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.39,0:17:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.30,0:17:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir Noor made incredible\Ncontributions on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.83,0:17:30.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He needs a reward worthy of his deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.17,0:17:31.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.25,0:17:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not necessary. Pardon me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm flattered by the offer, but\NI don't really need anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.59,0:17:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, you cannot blow it\Noff and refuse me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.59,0:17:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need to provide you\Nwith the proper reward or
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.41,0:17:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,else it will set a poor\Nexample for everybody else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.33,0:17:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get all that, but, man,\Nthis family, they are so pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.75,0:17:53.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even after you tell them\Nyou don't want anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.43,0:17:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, actually, there is one thing\NI'd like to ask for. Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.29,0:18:00.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead, just name it, anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:05.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, uh, I would like for\Nyou to help this kid out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.03,0:18:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Help me? But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.33,0:18:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This child is demon folk, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.07,0:18:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is, and he doesn't\Nhave anyone to live with.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.89,0:18:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because he was abandoned by\Na group of slave merchants.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.81,0:18:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What might be your request for the boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.71,0:18:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could live in the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.31,0:18:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just needs a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.11,0:18:28.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, just like all the\Nother people living there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would have him live with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.59,0:18:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it would probably be better for him\Nif he were with a family with some money.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.67,0:18:38.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a guy like me, with no real income.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.21,0:18:40.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Instructor Noor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.01,0:18:44.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At one point, you said you'd\Ngive me a house and land.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.77,0:18:46.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something like that\Nwould be great for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.01,0:18:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And some clothes and food if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.85,0:18:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.45,0:18:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in order for that to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.39,0:18:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he must first become a lawful\Ncitizen of this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.33,0:18:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you wish for him, Sonor?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.83,0:19:01.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has saved me several times\Nthroughout our journey together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.99,0:19:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the only reason that huge dragon did\Nwhat it did was because Rolo was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.53,0:19:07.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.47,0:19:10.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was because you were a -\NThere's no need to be humble now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.51,0:19:14.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Rolo weren't there, the war\Nwould not have ended so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.81,0:19:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He deserves it, Your Highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:19.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of all the things he could request,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.13,0:19:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the holy theocracy of Mithra\Nregards the demon-focused enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.43,0:19:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Accepting one into our kingdom\Nwill cause a rift in our relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And please believe me, I don't\Nneed anything other than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.47,0:19:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you still want to give out some\Nrewards, then do that for someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.53,0:19:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no shortage of people\Nwho lost everything in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.61,0:19:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really where we should be focusing\Nall our efforts right now anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:47.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:51.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matter of fact, I'm wondering\Nwho's the king here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.41,0:19:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy really does like to laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:04.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm to be reborn,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:10.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only hope I won't have to spend\Nthat life with so much suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.65,0:20:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope I can be at least a\Nlittle more useful to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.31,0:20:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I hope I can have something\Ndelicious to eat at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.05,0:20:22.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Life doesn't have to be this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.95,0:20:40.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the time being, you\Nwill be living here with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.95,0:20:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So welcome home, Rolo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:48.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.85,0:20:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They made a nice meal for us, but it'll\Nget cold if you don't go ahead and eat
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.39,0:20:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, I can eat all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.11,0:20:57.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course you can eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.63,0:20:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.75,0:21:01.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or is it something that\Nyou don't really like?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.13,0:21:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is real food
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.65,0:21:14.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eat, don't be shy. Rolo, everything's\Nfine. Have as much as you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:20.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will be upset with you,\Nokay? Then I'll try some. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.37,0:21:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the pretzel soft and fluffy
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.29,0:21:46.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.59,0:21:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can slow down, Rolo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.55,0:22:00.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one will take it away.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.10,0:22:10.06,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#11 I Parry Divine Wrath
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that I have believed in the
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.45,0:22:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miracle of my
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.39,0:22:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dreams. What
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.65,0:22:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.17,0:22:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.51,0:22:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.73,0:22:43.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have left my heart.\NI have left my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.85,0:22:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I wanna hear you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.85,0:22:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I will not
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.61,0:22:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be able to hear you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.01,0:22:56.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.17,0:22:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't want to hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.71,0:23:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.79,0:23:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.47,0:23:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.

